{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Sarek_hip.Hip_api</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"sarek-hip","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Sarek_hip","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Hip_api","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Constants","href":"#constants","children":[]},{"title":"Error checking","href":"#error-checking","children":[]},{"title":"Device Management","href":"#device-management","children":[]},{"title":"Memory Management","href":"#memory-management","children":[]},{"title":"Stream Management","href":"#stream-management","children":[]},{"title":"Event Management","href":"#event-management","children":[]},{"title":"Ranged / asynchronous copies, pinned memory, stream ordering","href":"#ranged-/-asynchronous-copies,-pinned-memory,-stream-ordering","children":[]},{"title":"Kernel Management","href":"#kernel-management","children":[]},{"title":"Utility Functions","href":"#utility-functions","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<h2 id=\"constants\"><a href=\"#constants\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Constants</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-max_device_name_length\"><a href=\"#val-max_device_name_length\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> max_device_name_length : int</span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"error-checking\"><a href=\"#error-checking\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Error checking</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-check\"><a href=\"#val-check\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> check : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Hip_types/index.html#type-hip_result\">Hip_types.hip_result</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-kernargs\"><a href=\"#type-kernargs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> kernargs</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-kernargs.params\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kernargs.params\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>params : <span><span>unit <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-kernargs.slots\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kernargs.slots\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>slots : <span>int64 <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span>;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>hipModuleLaunchKernel is asynchronous and the HIP stack snapshots the kernel parameters at dispatch time, not at the call site (see the CUDA sibling's note - it explicitly calls out the HIP behaviour). Freeing the arg cells when <code>Kernel.launch</code> returns would be a use-after-free once the GC reclaims them. We retain them until the stream that ran the launch is drained, keyed by <code>(device_id, stream_key)</code>. The cells are held for liveness only and never inspected. A mutex guards the list against concurrent domains.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pending_kernargs\"><a href=\"#val-pending_kernargs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pending_kernargs : <span><span><span>(int * nativeint * <a href=\"#type-kernargs\">kernargs</a>)</span> list</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.ref</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pending_lock\"><a href=\"#val-pending_lock\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pending_lock : <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Mutex.t</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-retain_kernargs\"><a href=\"#val-retain_kernargs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> retain_kernargs : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>nativeint <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-kernargs\">kernargs</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-retire_stream\"><a href=\"#val-retire_stream\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> retire_stream : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>nativeint <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-retire_device\"><a href=\"#val-retire_device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> retire_device : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-stream_key_of_ptr\"><a href=\"#val-stream_key_of_ptr\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> stream_key_of_ptr : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> nativeint</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-default_stream_key\"><a href=\"#val-default_stream_key\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> default_stream_key : nativeint</span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"device-management\"><a href=\"#device-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Device Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Device\"><a href=\"#module-Device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Device/index.html\">Device</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"memory-management\"><a href=\"#memory-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Memory Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Memory\"><a href=\"#module-Memory\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Memory/index.html\">Memory</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"stream-management\"><a href=\"#stream-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Stream Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Stream\"><a href=\"#module-Stream\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Stream/index.html\">Stream</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"event-management\"><a href=\"#event-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Event Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Event\"><a href=\"#module-Event\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Event/index.html\">Event</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"ranged-/-asynchronous-copies,-pinned-memory,-stream-ordering\"><a href=\"#ranged-/-asynchronous-copies,-pinned-memory,-stream-ordering\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Ranged / asynchronous copies, pinned memory, stream ordering</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Async\"><a href=\"#module-Async\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Async/index.html\">Async</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"kernel-management\"><a href=\"#kernel-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Kernel Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Kernel\"><a href=\"#module-Kernel\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Kernel/index.html\">Kernel</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"utility-functions\"><a href=\"#utility-functions\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Utility Functions</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-runtime_version\"><a href=\"#val-runtime_version\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> runtime_version : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_available\"><a href=\"#val-is_available\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_available : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Available if libamdhip64 loads, libhiprtc loads, and at least one device is present. hiprtc is required because this backend is JIT-only (HIP C++ -&gt; code object at runtime).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-memory_info\"><a href=\"#val-memory_info\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> memory_info : <span><a href=\"Device/index.html#type-t\">Device.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int64 * int64</span></code></div></div>"}